        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Jazz was born in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "New Orleans",
            "zh": "新奥尔良"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in America. In the late 1800s and early 1900s, people from all over the world came to this "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "port",
            "zh": "港口"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " city. They brought European classical music*, American blues*, Latin music*, and African music*. All these came together to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "form",
            "ref": "v-form"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " “jazz”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Jazz "
          },
